    "note": "Public auto-showcase probability is intentionally low (0.5% per simulated receipt) because Lucky Contribution represents a rare event. The profile includes an explicit showcase control so a buyer can inspect the capability without making the normal event common. Production recognition must originate from an authoritative provider/research significance rule and receipt, never browser probability."
  },
  "profile_dashboard": {
