    "forbidden_adaptation_inputs": ["BET_SIZE", "LOSS_STREAK", "NEAR_MISS", "WAGERING_HISTORY", "PLAYER_VULNERABILITY", "COMPUTE_VOLUME_TO_GAME_ODDS"],
    "presentation_only": true,
    "affects_rng": false,
    "affects_payout": false,
    "affects_compute_route": false,
    "external_audio_assets_required": false,
    "note": "A unique session-seeded 16-step cosmic composition is generated locally with WebAudio. Game mode defines tonal DNA, compute route defines arrangement character, and neutral game/system events temporarily reshape tempo, density, register and fills. Solar Free Spins now keep the arrangement in a sustained bonus state and each bonus spin/retrigger reshapes the live sequence. Music never reads loss streaks, near-misses, wagering history, player vulnerability or bet size."
